  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Aadhar Card Download, Correction, Status 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:14:14+05:30\">January 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:14 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">The <strong>Aadhaar card, issued by the Unique Identification Authority of India (UIDAI),</strong> is also popularly known as <strong>“My Aadhaar, My Identity.”</strong> It serves as a unique identification document for every resident of India. This guide provides complete information on how to download the <strong>Aadhaar card, update it, change the registered mobile number, update the address, and make necessary corrections.</strong> You can also learn how to download your <strong>Aadhaar card directly from your mobile.</strong> All important details related to <strong>Aadhaar card services and registration are provided below,</strong> along with the application link in the important links section.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Aadhar Card Download, Correction, Status 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Aadhar Card Download, Correction, Status 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/aadhar-card-download-correction-status-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhar Card Scheme Launch : <strong>2009</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Enrollment Will be Begin : <strong>2009</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Enrollment in New Aadhar Card : <strong>As Per Schedule</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Biometric Update : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>100/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">PVC Card Order : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>50/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Demographic Update : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>50/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhar Enrollment : <b>0/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Appointment Fees :&nbsp;<b>0/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Aadhar Enrollment / Seva Kendra / CSC Center Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">NA</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Aadhar Card Download, Correction, Status 2026</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Aadhar Card Download, Correction, Status 2026</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Aadhar Card Facility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhar Card Enrollment</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Download E Aadhar</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Find UID and All Services of UIDAI</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;How to Enrolled With New Aadhar&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Find Your Nearest Enrollment Center to Choose Your State Name, District Name and Area.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Visit the center to submit your documents, along with a photograph and biometric details.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After a few days, your e-Aadhaar will be available for download from the official portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Online Correction E Aadhar Card&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After the Successfully Generating the Aadhar Card if you See Any Correction in Aadhar Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">For Any Correction Kindly Use Only Aadhar Card Correction Online or Enrollment Center.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After the Over the Correction Procedure Wait for the Few Days and Download E Aadhar.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Document Required For New Aadhar Card Enrollment&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.3057%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Photo ID Card</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 79.6943%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Passport, PAN Card, Ration/ PDS Photo Card, Voter ID, Driving License Etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.3057%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Address Proof </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 79.6943%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Passport, Bank Statement/ Passbook, Post Office Account Statement/ Passbook , Ration Card ,Voter ID ,Driving License, Government Photo ID cards/ service photo identity card issued by PSU . Electricity Bill (not older than 3 months) , Water Bill (not older than 3 months) . Telephone Landline Bill (not older than 3 months), Property Tax Receipt (not older than 1 year) Etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20.3057%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 79.6943%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Birth Certificate, SSLC Book / Certificate, Passport, Photo ID card having Date of Birth, PAN Card, Marksheet, Etc.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;How to Download E Aadhar Card&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">In order to print, verify or correct the Aadhar card, the applicant should open the official website of UIDAI.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Here the candidates will have to click on the useful link as per their requirements.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Applicants can get the electronic version of Aadhar Card by entering the Enrolment ID received at the time of enrolment in the registered mobile number.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Applicants who have enrolled for Aadhar Card can check their Aadhar generation status by providing the enrolment ID and their Date of Birth.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">In order to get Online /Offline Aadhar form (Hindi/English) and Update /Correction Form (Online/Offline) applicants shall be required to open the useful links as per their requirements.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #800000;\"><strong>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"wi